# Claude Code governance — git is the golden source (see RECOVERY.md).
# Ignore .claude by default, then re-admit the human-authored governance layer:
# rules, slash commands, subagents, scheduled-task definitions, launch config.
# Machine-local and generated content stays out.
.claude/*
!.claude/rules/
!.claude/commands/
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/scheduled-tasks/
!.claude/launch.json
# Local-only: machine paths, permission grants, 1.1GB of stale agent worktrees.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/worktrees/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

